    "scope": "Explicit artificial native save checkpoint: begins with KeyBasement held, not a claim of naturally reaching this point. Normal LOAD, source key-door unlock, MapPodunk grant, repeat and basement exit/reentry are compared semantically to pinned Godot present methods. No memory writes, pixel equivalence or original full save-loading claim.; continuous held DOWN through background preparation must reach the source map approach without release/repress.; The explicit checkpoint also sets talked_to_dad to admit the normal house exit. Then real input collects DogTreats, leaves, opens/closes START and returns with both presents retained. This checkpoint route does not reproduce prior battle memory residency; the separate natural opening-field-exit route does.",
